              "<body>\n",
              "<div class=\"container\">\n",
              "\n",
              "<h1>🔐 Phishing Awareness Training</h1>\n",
              "\n",
              "<p>\n",
              "Phishing is a cyber attack where attackers trick people into\n",
              "sharing sensitive information such as passwords, bank details,\n",
              "or OTPs.\n",
              "</p>\n",
              "\n",
              "<h2>1. How to Recognize Phishing Emails</h2>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"card\">\n",
              "<b>⚠️ Check the Sender:</b>\n",
              "Unexpected or suspicious email addresses may indicate phishing.\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"card\">\n",
              "<b>⚠️ Check Links:</b>\n",
              "Do not click suspicious links. Check the website address carefully.\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"card\">\n",
              "<b>⚠️ Urgent Messages:</b>\n",
              "Messages like \"Your account will be blocked today!\" are commonly\n",
              "used to create panic.\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"card\">\n",
              "<b>⚠️ Requests for Sensitive Information:</b>\n",
              "Legitimate organizations normally do not ask for passwords,\n",
              "PINs or OTPs through unexpected emails.\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<h2>2. How to Identify Fake Websites</h2>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"warning\">\n",
              "<b>Example:</b><br>\n",
              "A fake website may look similar to a banking or shopping website\n",
              "but use a suspicious domain name.\n",
              "<br><br>\n",
              "Always check:\n",
              "<ul>\n",
              "<li>Website address (URL)</li>\n",
              "<li>HTTPS connection</li>\n",
              "<li>Spelling and grammar</li>\n",
              "<li>Unexpected login/payment requests</li>\n",
              "</ul>\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<h2>3. Social Engineering Tactics</h2>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"card\">\n",
              "<b>Impersonation:</b> Attacker pretends to be a bank, company,\n",
              "teacher, friend or manager.\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"card\">\n",
              "<b>Fear:</b> \"Your account will be permanently deleted.\"\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"card\">\n",
              "<b>Urgency:</b> \"Complete the payment within 10 minutes.\"\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"card\">\n",
              "<b>Reward:</b> \"You won a prize! Click here to claim it.\"\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<h2>4. Best Practices</h2>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"safe\">\n",
              "<ul>\n",
              "<li>✔️ Verify the sender before responding.</li>\n",
              "<li>✔️ Never share passwords or OTPs.</li>\n",
              "<li>✔️ Avoid clicking unknown links.</li>\n",
              "<li>✔️ Use strong and unique passwords.</li>\n",
              "<li>✔️ Enable Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA).</li>\n",
              "<li>✔️ Keep software and browsers updated.</li>\n",
              "<li>✔️ Report suspicious emails to the organization.</li>\n",
              "</ul>\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<h2>5. Real-World Example</h2>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"warning\">\n",
