              "<input type=\"radio\" name=\"q1\" value=\"wrong\"> Forward it to friends\n",
              "</div>\n",
              "\n",
              "<div class=\"question\">\n",
              "<b>Q2. Which is a common phishing warning sign?</b><br><br>\n",
              "<input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"wrong\"> Normal communication<br>\n",
              "<input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"correct\"> Urgent request for sensitive information<br>\n",
              "<input type=\"radio\" name=\"q2\" value=\"wrong\"> Known contact with expected message\n",
